comments.body:
In my opinion you should complete all chain quests because they are there for a reason.&nbsp; This one gives you a Key to enter yes the hardest 5 man instance.&nbsp; So get the Key and you have peace of mind that you will always be able to get into the instace without tricks.

If your around 55-60 and doing this quest and worrying about 15g then you must be wearing outdated armor and items.&nbsp; A simple sollution to gold problems is to just go to Deadmines.&nbsp; Yes the little noob dungen, run threw the entire thing then run threw the Instance.&nbsp; Loot all magic items and all cloth then go to the AH and sell everything.&nbsp; 

This will take you about 1 to 2 hours and everything will sell and you will get at least 15g from that run.&nbsp; I go there run the entire thing then Instance then do it again untill all slots of my inventory are full (4 travelers)&nbsp; I get about 20-30g depending on AH prices.&nbsp; 

What you have to remember is ALL lower level items are way over priced because everyone uses them.&nbsp; And at 55 or higher you can simply tear threw deadmines killing grps of 5 or more at a time then shift click the corpses.&nbsp; its crazy fast cash so start making some and get new armor and items then get your key and stop worrying about money.&nbsp; 

Best money making profeshions are Skinning and Enchanting, you sell your sinning stuff and you DE BOP items and magic items that have crap stats then sell all your DE stuff.&nbsp; If you do this you will be crapping cash by level 30 and never have to worry about cash ever again.&nbsp; After your rich and you want to make stuff then fine switch profeshions and make stuff.
